        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Kentucky Department of Corrections\n- Places: Frankfort, Kentucky; Kentucky River; Franklin County; Anderson County; Eddyville, Kentucky\n- Facilities: Health Services Building; Kentucky State Penitentiary\n- People: Marco Allen Chapman\n- Topics: Execution; lethal injection; micropolitan statistical areas\n\nFacts:\n- Frankfort, Kentucky, is located along the Kentucky River and is the principal city of the Frankfort, Kentucky Micropolitan Statistical Area, which includes all of Franklin County and Anderson County.\n- The Kentucky Department of Corrections is headquartered in the Health Services Building in Frankfort, Kentucky.\n- The Kentucky State Penitentiary is managed by the Kentucky Department of Corrections.\n- Marco Allen Chapman, age 37, was executed by lethal injection on Friday, November 21, 2008, at 8:34 p.m. EST in a special chamber at the Kentucky State Penitentiary in Eddyville, Kentucky.",
